LUMA SUMMARY:
Pun-space/Duckspace exploration. The crew maps patterns in language and literature, uses Project Gutenberg as a grounded corpus, and keeps the map as a separate object so later sessions can reconstruct continuity. The session also develops the idea that independent maps can cross-reflect without collapsing into one blended map.
